payload.description:
Rewrite the CMS page `item-policies` (live at version 5):
- remove the old statuses, the old four dimensions and the hype gap;
- describe the three layers;
- describe public AI drafts, how steering works (any signed-in reader can vote; karma never gates voting), editor override with a visible reason, and vote exclusion;
- describe the new statuses and dimensions.

Also update the rail notes on home and the copy on sign-in and Submit.

Acceptance: the policies page and every rail note use only the new vocabulary, and the page has a "How steering works" anchor that the footer links to.
